Distinguish identity, performance, hazard and movement evidence (@cs-documents: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @chemical-supply-systems, #source "../sources/Chemical-Classification-and-Communication-GHS.lingua#r_3JK41Y6PYJ4063TNSBZ6ZJ50PG", #source "../sources/Pharmaceutical-Starting-Materials-WHO.lingua#r_7H51215T44S69TD3R0499VMTTY", #source "../sources/Manual-de-Produtos-Quimicos-CETESB.lingua#r_0XHPTEZZDB1M5KN5JPPZYPW79D", #chemical-supply-systems "../../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/feedstocks/Define-a-usable-chemical-product-and-its-evidence.lingua#r_535PMG683E3954QDWW0ERTPYG8") { r_67HK15SE94N6ASED8YKGMHNZP4
**Read:** [Globally Harmonized System of Classification and Labelling of Chemicals — UN](../sources/Chemical-Classification-and-Communication-GHS.lingua#r_3JK41Y6PYJ4063TNSBZ6ZJ50PG), introductory framework and the complete safety-data/label communication annexes; [Good trade and distribution practices for pharmaceutical starting materials — WHO](../sources/Pharmaceutical-Starting-Materials-WHO.lingua#r_7H51215T44S69TD3R0499VMTTY), sections 4, 6–7 and 12–13 in full; [Manual de Produtos Químicos — CETESB](../sources/Manual-de-Produtos-Quimicos-CETESB.lingua#r_0XHPTEZZDB1M5KN5JPPZYPW79D), the entire technical guide and the complete selected substance record, comparing its scope with an SDS.

A product specification states requirements or the producer's offered limits; a certificate of analysis reports evidence for an identified material; an SDS communicates hazards and relevant handling information; a delivery document records a movement and its parties. None of these automatically establishes the other three. An authentic document can also be attached to the wrong lot.

Gather authorized examples for one material and annotate the identifiers that connect them: manufacturer, product/grade, lot or period, revision, quantity, package, sample identity and test dates. Distinguish a measured value from “conforms,” a specification limit from a typical value, and a detected impurity from an analyte the method cannot resolve. An identification number may denote a substance, while the actual supplied object is a mixture or stabilized solution.

Build a small comparison table showing each document's question, author, scope, evidence and unresolved claims. Follow one missing connection all the way to the physical delivery. Use the GHS material for hazard communication and the starting-material guidance for documentary continuity. Later traceability work will preserve these distinctions: a sophisticated information link cannot establish unmeasured chemical properties or cure a mismatch between a sample and a delivered lot.

